text:
@vijaygajera That is the painting by Russian painter Nicholas Roerich who died in India.
His son was an Indian citizen & married actress Devika Rani.

Painting is called Banner of Peace of Roerich Pact (Treaty on the Protection of Artistic and Scientific Institutions and Historic Monuments)

